{
  "//": [
    "Generated by design/scripts/5-config-generate from design/family.json and design/apps.json: edit those, then run `mise run config:build` in design/.",
    "The MCP servers of every checked app, for every host: headless servers work on a document with no window; live servers drive the running desktop app.",
    "Read by: mise-tasks/claude-code/sync (writes .mcp.json for the apps installed here), mise-tasks/apps/watch (adds one live server to Claude Code)."
  ],
